<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Default locale = ARABIC (ANSWERS.md §12). English lives in values-en/.

    The plurals below carry `zero`/`one`/`two`/`few`/`many`/`other` because Arabic needs all six —
    a dual («يومان») that no other language in this app has, and a different form again for 3–10
    and for 11–99. This is the whole reason `RelativeTime` returns a bucket and a number instead
    of a sentence: nothing in Kotlin could produce these six forms for two locales.
-->
